An amorph is/has:
- a 'b' monster.
- Lots of hitpoints, and regeneration to boot.
- Very strong and fast.
- Incredibly hungry, so starvation becomes a major problem. However an
amorph can eat pretty much any % and has a eat/digest attack, and is
both acid and poison-resistant by default.
- Can #twoweapon, #threeweapon, #fourweapon...
- Can easily squeeze through iron bars, small gaps etc .
- Can't wear armour, except maybe shields, but to a certain extent
doesn't need to.
- An amorph can change shape, but doesn't have full polymorph
abilities. Can hide by mimicking a sink or toilet.
(http://www.schlockmercenary.com/d/20001002.html)
- Totally immune to slicing, stabbing, piercing, crushing and
decapitation/ bisection injury. Can only really be hurt by fire, cold
(?), lightning/electrical attacks (?), death rays/touches, explosions,
disintegration and stoning.
- That said, there is a small chance that any conventional attack will
permanently blind the amorph (until it can find new eyes, anyway).
- Fire and/or explosion attacks that damage the amorph reduce strength,
HP, MaxHP and also induce amnesia effects.



